  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Stir slowly at 4 -10°C for 3 hours, adjust pH to 7.6 with 5 M NaOH. Filter sterilize."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": "Dissolve 14.0 g gelatine in 200 ml bidest. water, autoclave 15 minutes at 115°C."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "comment": "Dissolve 50.05 g bovine serum albumine, fract. V (important: Sigma No A9647) in 143 ml bidest. water, or use BSA-solution Sigma A7409."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "comment": "Combine the warm (37°C) solutions A, B, C, D, and filter-sterilize the warm medium. Solution B can also be added after filtration."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "comment": "Alternatively, buy supplemented or un-supplementedBSK-H medium (Fa. Bio&SELLor Sigma) and supplement the medium according to manufacturer’s advice. Sterilize the mixed and warm (37°C) medium by filtration."
    }
  ]
}